  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組為 Minecraft 新增了垃圾桶。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>根據你製作的垃圾桶種類，它可以用來銷毀物品、能量、流體或實體。</p>\n<p>目前此模組共有 3 種垃圾桶：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>普通垃圾桶。</li>\n<li>流體垃圾桶。</li>\n<li>能量垃圾桶。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>若將普通垃圾桶搭建為 2 格高，它還可以銷毀實體。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vSwEElD.png\" alt=\"可銷毀實體的垃圾桶構造\" width=\"560\" height=\"371\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>製作配方：</h4>\n<p>普通垃圾桶</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Q8DFIL.png\" alt=\"普通垃圾桶配方\" width=\"242\" height=\"146\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;流體垃圾桶</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oGS9Vd0.png\" alt=\"流體垃圾桶配方\" width=\"242\" height=\"137\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;能量垃圾桶</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Cac6PSn.png\" alt=\"能量垃圾桶配方\" width=\"253\" height=\"140\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有任何問題，歡迎加入我的 Discord 伺服器。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord 連結\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我們嗎？</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fstekkie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器嗎？</a></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fstekkie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Etl1Cya.png\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
